{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "HL7 Subscription API",
    "description": "\nThe contract any application uses to receive HL7 records it chooses with Databricks SQL. The full guide, with\nexamples: docs/integration.md in the repo.\n\n**Authentication.** Call with `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is your app's Databricks service principal's\nOAuth token (machine-to-machine, from `https://<workspace>/oidc/v1/token`). The Databricks Apps proxy verifies it and\ntells the API who is calling. The service principal must be an onboarded subscriber app.\n\n**The handshake.** An app needs only its service principal and this API's Databricks App name (its URL is\n`GET https://<workspace>/api/2.0/apps/<name>` \u2192 `url`, which your CAN_USE grant allows).\n0. `GET /api/v1/connection`: your topic and how to read it (Kafka bootstrap servers, your Unity Catalog credential, and\n   the token scope to request), the hub that runs your rules, and the sources and columns you're granted.\n1. `PUT /api/v1/subscriptions` with the app's whole set of `{name, sql}`. Databricks compiles every rule in that call.\n   Either all are accepted (each with a `revision` and your `destination` topic), or nothing is applied and each refusal\n   carries Databricks' own error.\n2. `GET /api/v1/subscriptions?wait=25`, repeated until `state` is `READY`: the hub is running exactly those revisions.\n   `FAILED` and `HUB_STALE` are final answers too. Keep each call short (\u2264 25 s): a proxy in between may cut long\n   requests.\n3. Read your topic (Kafka protocol on Azure Event Hubs, OAUTHBEARER with a token Unity Catalog issues for your\n   credential: `POST /api/2.1/unity-catalog/temporary-service-credentials` on the workspace).\n   Deduplicate on `notificationId`, and act only on the `(subscriptionId, revision)` pairs you registered.\n\nA rule is `SELECT <columns> FROM <silver source> WHERE <filter>`, with any Databricks SQL built-in in the filter. The\nsame SQL against your views in the SQL editor returns the records you'll receive.\n\n**Hubs.** A hub is the pipeline that runs rules and delivers matches. The platform assigns each app one: `edp_shared`\n(the default), or a team's own hub, which serves only the apps assigned to it. Every app's `deferred` rules run on\n`edp_shared`'s deferred pipeline. Either way your calls, rules, and topic are the same; `hub` fields say which hub runs\nwhat, and only that hub's verdict and heartbeat count.\n\n**Compatibility.** Version 1 only adds fields: clients must ignore fields they don't know.\n",
    "version": "1"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "service"
        ],
        "summary": "Liveness",
        "operationId": "health",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Health"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/connection": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Your topic and how to read it (Kafka bootstrap, Unity Catalog credential, token scope), hub and grant",
        "operationId": "getConnection",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Connection"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "The platform hasn't finished onboarding this app",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/validate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Check rules without applying anything",
        "operationId": "validate",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Declared"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidateResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/subscriptions": {
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Declare your whole set (atomic; cancels what you no longer declare)",
        "operationId": "declare",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Declared"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeclareResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Refused: nothing applied; Databricks' error per rule",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefusedResult"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Your subscriptions and whether the hub runs them (optionally wait)",
        "operationId": "getStatus",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "wait",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "Seconds to wait for READY or FAILED (capped at 60; use <= 25)",
              "default": 0,
              "title": "Wait"
            },
            "description": "Seconds to wait for READY or FAILED (capped at 60; use <= 25)"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Status"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/subscriptions/{name}": {
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Create or change one subscription",
        "operationId": "putSubscription",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Name"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/One"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Accepted"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Refused: nothing applied; Databricks' error per rule",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefusedResult"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "summary": "Cancel one subscription",
        "operationId": "cancel",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Name"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cancelled"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No verified caller",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Not an onboarded subscriber app (APP_NOT_ONBOARDED)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No active subscription with that name",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "Accepted": {
        "properties": {
          "subscriptionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Subscriptionid",
            "description": "Stable for the subscription's life; notifications carry it"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Revision",
            "description": "Counts every change; an identical rule keeps its revision"
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "ACCEPTED",
            "title": "State"
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Query",
            "description": "The canonical SQL that's stored and run"
          },
          "destination": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Destination",
            "description": "Your topic: where notifications arrive"
          },
          "template": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Template",
            "description": "The data template the rule is held to, if any"
          },
          "tier": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Tier",
            "description": "realtime or deferred",
            "default": "realtime"
          },
          "hub": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Hub",
            "description": "The hub that runs it: your app's hub for realtime rules, edp_shared for deferred ones",
            "examples": [
              "edp_shared"
            ]
          },
          "unchanged": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Unchanged",
            "description": "True when the rule was already active as is"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "subscriptionId",
          "name",
          "revision",
          "state",
          "query",
          "destination"
        ],
        "title": "Accepted"
      },
      "Cancelled": {
        "properties": {
          "subscriptionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Subscriptionid"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Revision"
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "CANCELLING",
            "title": "State",
            "description": "The hub stops it at its next batch (then CANCELLED)"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "subscriptionId",
          "name",
          "revision",
          "state"
        ],
        "title": "Cancelled"
      },
      "Checked": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Query"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "query"
        ],
        "title": "Checked"
      },
      "Connection": {
        "properties": {
          "app": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "App"
          },
          "topic": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Topic",
            "description": "Your topic: the Kafka topic your notifications arrive on (same as `destination`)"
          },
          "bootstrapServers": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Bootstrapservers",
            "description": "Kafka bootstrap servers (SASL_SSL, OAUTHBEARER)",
            "examples": [
              "hl7rtmaz-ehns.servicebus.windows.net:9093"
            ]
          },
          "credential": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Credential",
            "description": "Your Unity Catalog service credential. Mint the Kafka token with it, as your service principal: POST <workspace>/api/2.1/unity-catalog/temporary-service-credentials {\"credential_name\": credential, \"azure_options\": {\"resources\": [tokenScope]}} -> azure_aad.aad_token",
            "examples": [
              "sub_my_app_eventhubs"
            ]
          },
          "tokenScope": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Tokenscope",
            "description": "The resource to request the Kafka token for",
            "examples": [
              "https://hl7rtmaz-ehns.servicebus.windows.net/.default"
            ]
          },
          "hub": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Hub",
            "description": "The hub that runs your realtime rules (the platform assigns it): edp_shared, or your team's own hub. Your deferred rules run on edp_shared.",
            "examples": [
              "edp_shared"
            ]
          },
          "sources": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Sources",
            "description": "The silver sources you may subscribe to"
          },
          "fields": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Fields",
            "description": "The columns you may read and filter on (a data template may narrow them)"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "app",
          "topic",
          "bootstrapServers",
          "credential",
          "tokenScope",
          "hub",
          "sources",
          "fields"
        ],
        "title": "Connection",
        "description": "Everything an app needs to read its notifications, so it configures only its service principal and the API."
      },
      "DeclareResult": {
        "properties": {
          "applied": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "const": true,
            "title": "Applied"
          },
          "accepted": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Accepted"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Accepted"
          },
          "cancelled": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cancelled"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Cancelled",
            "description": "Subscriptions you no longer declare"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "applied",
          "accepted",
          "cancelled"
        ],
        "title": "DeclareResult"
      },
      "Declared": {
        "properties": {
          "subscriptions": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Item"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Subscriptions",
            "description": "Your app's whole set: anything not listed is cancelled"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "subscriptions"
        ],
        "title": "Declared"
      },
      "Error": {
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Code",
            "description": "UNAUTHENTICATED, APP_NOT_ONBOARDED, DUPLICATE_NAME, NOT_FOUND_OR_INACCESSIBLE"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "Error"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "Health": {
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Ok"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "ok"
        ],
        "title": "Health"
      },
      "Heartbeat": {
        "properties": {
          "hub": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Hub",
            "description": "The hub",
            "examples": [
              "edp_shared"
            ]
          },
          "tier": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Tier",
            "description": "realtime or deferred: which of its pipelines"
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Source",
            "description": "The silver source it read"
          },
          "lastBatchAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Lastbatchat",
            "description": "When it last processed a batch of the source (ISO 8601)"
          },
          "batchId": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "title": "Batchid"
          },
          "rules": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Rules",
            "description": "Rules it ran on the source in that batch"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "hub",
          "tier",
          "source",
          "lastBatchAt",
          "batchId",
          "rules"
        ],
        "title": "Heartbeat"
      },
      "Item": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name",
            "description": "1-63 lowercase letters, digits, or '-'; unique within your app",
            "examples": [
              "critical-potassium"
            ]
          },
          "sql": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Sql",
            "description": "SELECT <columns> FROM <silver source> WHERE <filter>, in Databricks SQL",
            "examples": [
              "SELECT patient_id, value_num, units FROM silver_observations WHERE observation_cd_desc = 'Potassium' AND value_num >= 6.5"
            ]
          },
          "template": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Template",
            "description": "A data template granted to your app: the rule may read, filter on, and receive only the template's columns (TEMPLATE_DENIED otherwise). Omitted: your app's whole grant.",
            "examples": [
              "ed-respiratory-monitoring"
            ]
          },
          "tier": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "realtime",
              "deferred"
            ],
            "title": "Tier",
            "description": "realtime: delivered within seconds (clinical), by your app's hub. deferred: delivered by edp_shared's deferred pipeline on a longer trigger, for work that can wait (e.g. billing); it never shares a batch with realtime rules.",
            "default": "realtime"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "sql"
        ],
        "title": "Item"
      },
      "One": {
        "properties": {
          "sql": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Sql",
            "description": "SELECT <columns> FROM <silver source> WHERE <filter>, in Databricks SQL"
          },
          "template": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Template",
            "description": "A data template granted to your app: the rule may read, filter on, and receive only the template's columns (TEMPLATE_DENIED otherwise). Omitted: your app's whole grant.",
            "examples": [
              "ed-respiratory-monitoring"
            ]
          },
          "tier": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "realtime",
              "deferred"
            ],
            "title": "Tier",
            "description": "realtime: delivered within seconds (clinical), by your app's hub. deferred: delivered by edp_shared's deferred pipeline on a longer trigger, for work that can wait (e.g. billing); it never shares a batch with realtime rules.",
            "default": "realtime"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "sql"
        ],
        "title": "One"
      },
      "Refusal": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Code",
            "description": "Databricks' error class (UNRESOLVED_COLUMN, PARSE_SYNTAX_ERROR, ...) or ours (SQL_NOT_ALLOWED, INVALID_NAME, RULE_LIMIT_REACHED, TEMPLATE_DENIED)"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "Refusal"
      },
      "RefusedResult": {
        "properties": {
          "applied": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "const": false,
            "title": "Applied"
          },
          "refused": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Refusal"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Refused"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "applied",
          "refused"
        ],
        "title": "RefusedResult"
      },
      "Status": {
        "properties": {
          "app": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "App"
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "READY",
              "PENDING",
